        "original_id": "aeacaaa9-bb8b-5e59-89bf-4208bb5f6ccd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Richardson, Giorgio Ferroni, Peter Strauss, Giuliano Gemma, Teresa Gimpera, Nello Pazzafini\n- Films: Penalty Phase, Wanted (1967 film)\n- Roles: film director, producer, theatre director, film editor, screenwriter, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Giorgio Ferroni was born on April 12, 1908, and died on August 17, 1981.\n- Giorgio Ferroni, sometimes credited as Calvin Jackson Padget or Calvin J. Padget, was an Italian film director, film editor, and screenwriter.\n- Tony Richardson was born on 5 June 1928 and died on 14 November 1991.\n- Tony Richardson was an English theatre and film director and producer whose career spanned five decades.\n- Wanted, a 1967 film, was directed by Giorgio Ferroni and starred Giuliano Gemma, Teresa Gimpera, and Nello Pazzafini.\n- Penalty Phase is a 1986 American television thriller-drama film directed by Tony Richardson and starring Peter Strauss.",
